Payload pin reconciliation (c82855d0 / 1f2431b / 8fc55919)
----------------------------------------------------------
The owner-approved payload pin `c82855d0756c748cc4770246a19282323cdfa331` is the
ANNOTATED TAG OBJECT for tag `0.1.0` (`robotstxtbing 0.1.0 -- first frozen
release`, BING-osxlywax R8). It is a tag object, not a commit; its recorded
target commit is `1f2431b9d47ba25dec313eec5a396e795f00b5b8` (R8). Recording the
tag object as the pin is stronger than a bare tag: the target commit is embedded
in the object, so the pin resolves deterministically.

