changed. The shipped release audit states this directly: the 0.1.0 audit is
"docs-only over the frozen library ... the shipped contract_info() identity and
library artifacts are exactly those proven by R1-R7." Consequently
`contract_info()` identity and every vendored file SHA-256 recorded in the
manifest are byte-identical between the audited commit (`8fc55919`) and the
pinned release tree (`1f2431b`, tag object `c82855d0`). The audit remains valid
